OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBands of
OL,6,Frain move east-northeastwards with
OL,7,Fclear spells in between. Heavy showers
OL,8,Ffollow into the southwest, where it
OL,9,Fbecomes windy with coastal gales
OL,10,Fdeveloping. Turning chilly in any
OL,11,Fclearer spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FRain continues to push
OL,14,Facross Scotland, turning heavy at
OL,15,Ftimes. Elsewhere, showers and squally
OL,16,Frain move east, heavy and possibly
OL,17,Fthundery near southern and
OL,18,Fsouthwestern coasts. Windy across the
OL,19,Fsouth.
